{"title":"루트를 거부하는 방법","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=bG3clW/dJMb9QE51Le/KPvyCmCMiM9TLlkIkbsIw0&filename=th3","synopsis":"[체력이 1만큼 깎입니다.]\n[체력이 고갈되어 정신을 잃습니다.(최대체력:1)]\n\n……뭐, 씨발?\n\n새로 얻은 몸은 끔찍하게도 심약하고 여렸다. 작은 충격에도 픽픽 쓰러지고, 그에 주위 사람들은 싸고 돌고, 밖에 나가지도 못하게 하니 아주 환장할 지경이다. 분명 죽었다 생각했는데…. 차 사고로 정신을 잃었다 깨어나 보니 듣도 보도 못한 게임 속에 들어와 있었다.\n\n[호감도] 공략 가능한 인물을 표시합니다\n아인스 루트\n조이 루트\n로베인 루트\n일리야 디페리우스\n카르얀 디페리우스\n\n루트를 선택하시겠습니까? (예/아니오)","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":142,"change":{"type":"down","amount":28}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":70,"change":{"type":"up","amount":72}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":104,"change":{"type":"down","amount":34}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":157,"change":{"type":"down","amount":53}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":142,"change":{"type":"up","amount":15}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":158,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":197,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":152,"change":{"type":"up","amount":45}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":139,"change":{"type":"up","amount":13}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":92,"change":{"type":"up","amount":47}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":97,"change":{"type":"down","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":166,"change":{"type":"down","amount":70}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":157,"change":{"type":"up","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":159,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":159,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":118,"change":{"type":"up","amount":41}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":62,"change":{"type":"up","amount":56}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":93,"change":{"type":"down","amount":31}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":107,"change":{"type":"down","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-09-02","rank":107,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-03","rank":75,"change":{"type":"up","amount":32}},{"date":"2026-09-05","rank":192,"change":{"type":"